---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Page Not Found (404) | Paranjape Forest Trails Bhugaon"
  description="The requested page could not be found. Explore 190-acre Paranjape Forest Trails Township in Bhugaon, Pune West featuring NA plots, luxury villas, and hillside apartments."
>
  <section style="min-height: 70vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 4rem 1.5rem; text-align: center; background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%, rgba(107, 13, 13, 0.25) 0%, #09090b 70%);">
    <div style="max-width: 750px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <span style="display: inline-block; background: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.15); color: #D4AF37; border: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.4); padding: 0.35rem 1rem; border-radius: 50px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        ✦ 404 ERROR — PAGE NOT FOUND
      </span>
      <h1 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.2rem); color: #ffffff; margin: 0 0 1.2rem; line-height: 1.15;">
        You've Veered Off the <span style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #D4AF37, #FFFFFF); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;">Forest Trail</span>
      </h1>
      <p style="color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.65; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;">
        The enclave, brochure, or page you are looking for may have moved or been updated. Let us guide you back to Pune's premier 190-acre township ecosystem.
      </p>

      <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
        <a
          href="/"
          style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6B0D0D, #8B1A1A); color: #ffffff; border: 1.5px solid #D4AF37; padding: 0.85rem 1.8rem; border-radius: 50px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(107, 13, 13, 0.5);"
        >
          RETURN TO TOWNSHIP HOME →
        </a>
        <a
          href="/paranjape-forest-trails-township-bhugaon-misty-greens/"
          style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); color: #ffffff; border: 1.5px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.4); padding: 0.85rem 1.8rem; border-radius: 50px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-decoration: none;"
        >
          EXPLORE MISTY GREENS PLOTS
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Enclave Links Grid -->
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; text-align: left; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 1.5rem;">
        <a href="/paranjape-forest-trails-township-bhugaon-rivolo-residences/" style="color: #D4AF37; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700;">
          🏰 The Rivolo Villas (₹3.89 Cr*) →
        </a>
        <a href="/paranjape-forest-trails-township-bhugaon-the-cove/" style="color: #D4AF37; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700;">
          🏡 The Cove Duets (₹2.85 Cr*) →
        </a>
        <a href="/paranjape-forest-trails-township-bhugaon-the-canopy/" style="color: #60A5FA; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700;">
          🏢 The Canopy Flats (₹89 L*) →
        </a>
        <a href="/paranjape-forest-trails-township-bhugaon-everglades/" style="color: #00c49f; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700;">
          🌿 Everglades PRO Homes (₹48.50 L*) →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
